## Architecture Overview

### Core Components

```
config-rs/
├── config-rs/          # Main library
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── lib.rs              # Public API
│   │   ├── config.rs           # Config trait
│   │   ├── source.rs           # Source trait
│   │   ├── sources/            # Built-in sources
│   │   │   ├── file.rs
│   │   │   ├── env.rs
│   │   │   └── cli.rs
│   │   ├── validation.rs       # Validation engine
│   │   ├── watch.rs            # Hot reload engine
│   │   ├── error.rs            # Error types
│   │   └── macros/             # Procedural macros
│   │       ├── config.rs       # #[derive(Config)]
│   │       └── validation.rs   # #[config(...)]
│   ├── Cargo.toml
│   └── README.md
├── config-rs-derive/   # Derive macros (separate crate)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── lib.rs
│   │   └── config.rs
│   └── Cargo.toml
└── examples/
    ├── basic.rs
    ├── layered.rs
    ├── validation.rs
    └── hot_reload.rs
```

---

### Data Flow

```
User Code (#[derive(Config)])
         ↓
   Derive Macro (config-rs-derive)
         ↓
   Generated Code (impl Config)
         ↓
   Source Abstraction (File, Env, CLI, Remote)
         ↓
   Layer Engine (Merge with priority)
         ↓
   Validation Engine (Built-in + custom)
         ↓
   Type-Safe Instance (Settings struct)
```

---

### Key Design Decisions

1. **Procedural Macros**: Zero boilerplate via derive macros
2. **Source Trait**: Extensible configuration sources
3. **Layer Engine**: Priority-based merging
4. **Validation**: Automatic validation with great errors
5. **Hot Reload**: File watching with debouncing
6. **Secret Integration**: Secure handling via secret-rs

---

