Data: [25.0, 30.0, 35.0, 40.0, 45.0, 50.0, 55.0, 60.0]

Sum: 340.0
Mean: 42.50
Variance: 143.75
Std Dev: 11.99

Plaintext verification:
Mean: 42.50 (error: 0.000001)
Variance: 143.75 (error: 0.000023)
Std Dev: 11.99 (error: 0.000001)

--- Performance Profile ---
encrypt_batch: 1 ops, avg 5.45 ms
sum_slots: 2 ops, avg 15.23 ms
mul: 3 ops, avg 4.87 ms
pow: 1 ops, avg 9.12 ms
