## Architecture Overview

### Core Components

```
flow-rs/
├── flow-core/       # Core stream processing engine
├── flow-operators/  # Built-in operators
├── flow-sources/    # Source implementations
├── flow-sinks/      # Sink implementations
└── flow-cli/        # CLI tool
```

### Data Flow

```
Source → Operator → Operator → Window → Aggregate → Sink
   ↓        ↓          ↓          ↓         ↓         ↓
 State    State      State     State     State    State
   ↓        ↓          ↓          ↓         ↓         ↓
 Checkpoint Coordinator (for fault tolerance)
```

### Key Traits

```rust
// All operators implement this
pub trait Operator {
    type Input;
    type Output;

    fn process(&mut self, event: Self::Input) -> Result<Vec<Self::Output>>;

    fn on_watermark(&mut self, watermark: Watermark) -> Result<Vec<Self::Output>> {
        Ok(Vec::new())
    }
}

// All sources implement this
pub trait Source {
    type Output;

    fn start(&mut self) -> BoxStream<Result<Self::Output>>;
}

// All sinks implement this
pub trait Sink {
    type Input;

    fn write(&mut self, event: Self::Input) -> Result<()>;
}
```

