## Architecture Overview

### System Components

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Application Layer                     │
│  (Counter, Gauge, Histogram, Summary, Custom Metrics)  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                     Registry Layer                       │
│  (Metric registration, storage, scraping)               │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                   Formatter Layer                        │
│  (Prometheus text format generation)                    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    Storage Layer                         │
│  (AtomicU64, AtomicF64, HashMap, RwLock)                │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Key Design Decisions

1. **Lock-Free Metrics**: Atomic operations for Counter/Gauge (no mutex)
2. **Global Registry**: Singleton for convenience (opt-in custom)
3. **Sorted Labels**: Sort at registration (not scrape) for performance
4. **Pre-allocated Buffer**: 1MB string buffer for scraping
5. **Type Safety**: Builder pattern with compile-time validation

