5. **Open PR** on GitHub

### PR Requirements

- [ ] Tests pass (`cargo test`)
- [ ] Zero clippy warnings
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] CHANGELOG.md entry added
- [ ] Commit messages follow conventional commits

### Commit Messages

Format: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`

**Types**:
- `feat`: New feature
- `fix`: Bug fix
- `docs`: Documentation changes
- `test`: Test changes
- `refactor`: Code refactoring
- `perf`: Performance improvement
- `chore`: Maintenance tasks

**Examples**:
```
feat(histogram): Add exponential bucket generation
fix(counter): Race condition in concurrent increment
docs(registry): Add scrape performance notes
```

---

## Getting Help

- **Issues**: https://github.com/SuperInstance/metrics-rs/issues
- **Discussions**: https://github.com/SuperInstance/metrics-rs/discussions
- **Discord**: https://discord.gg/superinstance

---

## License

MIT OR Apache-2.0

