## Sampling Strategies

### Fixed-Rate Sampling

```rust
pub struct FixedRateSampler {
    frequency: Hz,
}

impl FixedRateSampler {
    pub fn new(frequency: Hz) -> Self {
        Self { frequency }
    }
}

impl Sampler for FixedRateSampler {
