### 1.2 Core Traits

**Algorithm Trait:**
```rust
pub trait Algorithm: Send + Sync + 'static {
    fn check(
        &self,
        key: &str,
        state: &mut AlgorithmState,
        tokens: u32,
    ) -> LimitResult;

    fn reset(&self, state: &mut AlgorithmState);

    fn initial_state(&self) -> AlgorithmState;

    fn memory_per_key(&self) -> usize;
}
```

**Backend Trait:**
```rust
#[async_trait]
pub trait Backend: Send + Sync + 'static {
    async fn load_state(
        &self,
        key: &str,
        init: impl Fn() -> AlgorithmState,
    ) -> Result<Box<AlgorithmState>, BackendError>;

    async fn save_state(
        &self,
        key: &str,
        state: &AlgorithmState,
    ) -> Result<(), BackendError>;

    async fn reset_state(&self, key: &str) -> Result<(), BackendError>;

    async fn exists(&self, key: &str) -> Result<bool, BackendError>;

    async fn cleanup_expired(&self, ttl: Duration) -> Result<usize, BackendError>;
}
```

**KeyExtractor Trait:**
```rust
pub trait KeyExtractor: Send + Sync + 'static {
    fn extract_key(&self, request: &Request) -> Result<String, KeyError>;

    fn key_type(&self) -> &'static str;
}
```

