## 4. Working with Complex Types

### 4.1 Structs

```rust
#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]
struct Address {
    street: String,
    city: String,
    country: String,
}

#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]
struct User {
    id: u32,
