## Architecture Overview

### Component Diagram

```
timeseries-rs/
├── src/
│   ├── lib.rs              # Public API
│   ├── database.rs         # Database struct, open/close
│   ├── point.rs            # Point API
│   ├── query.rs            # Query builder, executor
│   ├── storage/
│   │   ├── mod.rs          # Storage engine
│   │   ├── wal.rs          # Write-ahead log
│   │   ├── cache.rs        # In-memory cache
│   │   ├── tsm.rs          # TSM file format
│   │   ├── compactor.rs    # Compaction logic
│   │   └── index.rs        # Series, tag, time indexes
│   ├── compression/
│   │   ├── mod.rs          # Compression algorithms
│   │   ├── gorilla.rs      # Gorilla (floats)
│   │   ├── delta.rs        # Delta-of-delta (timestamps)
│   │   ├── simple8b.rs     # Simple-8b (integers)
│   │   └── dictionary.rs   # Dictionary (strings)
│   ├── query/
│   │   ├── mod.rs          # Query engine
│   │   ├── planner.rs      # Query planner
│   │   ├── executor.rs     # Query executor
│   │   ├── aggregate.rs    # Aggregation functions
│   │   └── filter.rs       # Filter pushdown
│   └── admin.rs            # Admin API (downsample, retention)
```

### Data Flow

**Write Path**:
```
Application
  → Point API
  → Database::write()
  → WAL::append() (fsync)
  → Cache::insert()
  → Background: Cache::flush() → TSM::write() → Index::update()
```

**Read Path**:
```
Application
  → Query API
  → Query::plan() (planner)
  → Executor::execute()
  → Index::find_series() (series index)
  → Index::find_files() (time index)
  → TSM::read_blocks()
  → Compression::decompress()
  → Aggregate::compute()
  → Return results
```

