### Optimization Tips

**1. Reduce Allocations**:
```rust
// ❌ Bad: Allocates for each point
for point in points {
    let series_key = point.series_key();  // Allocates String
    cache.insert(series_key, point);
}

// ✅ Good: Reuse allocation
let mut series_key = SeriesKey::new();
for point in points {
    series_key.update(&point);
    cache.insert(&series_key, point);
}
```

**2. Use Vec with Capacity**:
```rust
// ❌ Bad: Reallocates
let mut points = Vec::new();
for i in 0..1000 {
    points.push(Point::new("metric").field("value", i));
}

// ✅ Good: Pre-allocate
let mut points = Vec::with_capacity(1000);
for i in 0..1000 {
    points.push(Point::new("metric").field("value", i));
}
```

**3. Avoid Cloning**:
```rust
// ❌ Bad: Clones point
fn process(point: Point) { /* ... */ }

// ✅ Good: Borrows point
fn process(point: &Point) { /* ... */ }
```

